 "notes": "Tom Green County lists 18 Election Day polling places with no precinct assignments and has used countywide polling in past elections, but the November 2026 documents do not say so explicitly, so confirm with the Elections Office (325-659-6541). Only the main branch at the Keyes Building stays open 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. in the second week of early voting; most addresses are in San Angelo but the county does not print the city for them."
